+/**
+ * 404 page (App Router `not-found.tsx`). Rendered whenever `notFound()` is
+ * called — e.g. an unknown codex/journal/reading slug — or a route simply does
+ * not exist. Reuses the reading layout so a missing page still feels like part
+ * of the Realm rather than the bare Next.js default.
